# Raid boss information (RaidbossInfo): an Adventurer Guildsman's link opens the raid boss
# levels, whose level 20 link is the page it names; its links mark a raid boss on the radar where
# one stands (Greyclaw Kutus, Pan Dryad), and nothing for one that is not in the world (Tirak).
# The reference probe keeps the scenario's spawns alone, so the radar finds no datapack spawn.
# The mark at a spawn's point that differs from where its boss stands is in
# tests/npcs/raidboss_info_test.go. Expectations are the reference trace's (RaidbossInfo.onTalk,
# onAdvEvent).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/raidboss_info_pages.golden
character Seeker 20
script script.feature.RaidbossInfo
page adventurer_guildsman/31729.htm
page script/feature/RaidbossInfo/
npc guild 31729 Adventurer 10 0 0
npc kutus 25001 RaidBoss 600 300 0
npc dryad 25019 RaidBoss -700 400 0

action guild
action guild
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=guild item=0 page=adventurer_guildsman/31729.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{guild}_Quest RaidbossInfo
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=guild item=0 page=script/feature/RaidbossInfo/info.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest RaidbossInfo level20.htm
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=guild item=0 page=script/feature/RaidbossInfo/level20.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest RaidbossInfo 25001
  S RadarControl show=2 type=2 loc=610,320,30
  S RadarControl show=0 type=1 loc=610,320,30
bypass Quest RaidbossInfo 25019
  S RadarControl show=2 type=2 loc=-690,420,30
  S RadarControl show=0 type=1 loc=-690,420,30
bypass Quest RaidbossInfo 25038
